[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10687.03, "timestamp": "02:58:07", "text": "でも、今日は木曜日でしたよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10688.349, "timestamp": "02:58:08", "text": "明日は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10692.4, "timestamp": "02:58:12", "text": "週末は日曜日ですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10693.469, "timestamp": "02:58:13", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10696.15, "timestamp": "02:58:16", "text": "とにかく、君と一緒に過ごしたいんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10697.389, "timestamp": "02:58:17", "text": "みんな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10701.51, "timestamp": "02:58:21", "text": "実は。わからない。わからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10704.51, "timestamp": "02:58:24", "text": "皆さんが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10706.51, "timestamp": "02:58:26", "text": "無料ですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10709.269, "timestamp": "02:58:29", "text": "そう、サーバーが必要なんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10712.51, "timestamp": "02:58:32", "text": "活動的でもある。あまりそうしたくない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10716.389, "timestamp": "02:58:36", "text": "非アクティブ。ええ、いくつかやってみようと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10718.63, "timestamp": "02:58:38", "text": "イベントか何かを企画してみます。しかし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10721.51, "timestamp": "02:58:41", "text": "また、心配なのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10723.51, "timestamp": "02:58:43", "text": "ああ、そう、明日の金曜日だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10726.83, "timestamp": "02:58:46", "text": "ホンのおかげで長い流れになる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10731.87, "timestamp": "02:58:51", "text": "カイ。だから、それがどういうことになるのか理解できない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10734.67, "timestamp": "02:58:54", "text": "行く。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10737.07, "timestamp": "02:58:57", "text": "H"}]